I understood in a way that I should include constraints for the lower order factors like below, but it still gives the same error.

model <- "F1 =~ NA*V8 + V7 + V6 + V3
        F2 =~ NA*V1 + V2 + V6 + V5 + V3
        F3 =~ NA*V4 + V5 + V6
        M =~ NA*F1 + F2 + F3
        M ~~ 1*M
        V5 ~~ a*V5
        a > 0.001
        M ~ SNP

        F1 ~~ b*F1
        F2 ~~ c*F2
        F3 ~~ d*F3
        b > 0.001
        c > 0.001
        d > 0.001
        "

Thank you!

Austin.

